{"message":"Using the ending gross unrecognized tax benefit balance from the reconciliation table ($139,549 thousand, approximately $139.5 million) and the stated $15.3 million of accrued interest and penalties, the percentage is: 15.3 / 139.549 × 100 ≈ 10.96%.","final":{"answer":"The combined amount of accrued interest and penalties was approximately 10.96% of the ending balance as of November 28, 2008.","value":"10.963890819712072","unit":"percent","sources":{"combined_accrued_interest_penalties":"source:q2n2","ending_balance_unrecognized_tax_benefits":"source:t6c1n0"},"result_id":"tool:1"}}